{{Kunark Era}}
Also known as "Charasis", '''Howling Stones''' was built by the vain [[Venril Sathir]] as his own personal retreat, where he studied and perfected the arts of necromancy. The zone is now filled with the remaining, eternal minions he created for himself and the lingering spirit of his ancient companion, [[Drusella Sathir]]. There is a quest that you must perform to obtain the key to enter this zone: the [[Key to Charasis Quest]]. Be prepared upon entering, however, as you will be set upon by mostly undead creatures.
